                <pb facs="1174" n="1164" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1164"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/11–1649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-16T13:00:00+08:00">November 16,
                            1949—1 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 16—2:11 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4804. ReDeptel 2271. Pattison Company, Isbrandtsen agent, has radioed Master <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Flying Cloud</hi> for details. Will reply soonest.
                    British <hi rendition="#italic">Wosang</hi> and <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Tsinan</hi>, held in Yangtze territorial waters, released by Chinese
                    gunboat and sailed for Hong Kong November 16. Local company offices unaware
                    reason for release. Norwegian <hi rendition="#italic">Promise</hi>, food gone,
                    gave up attempt enter and sailed for Tsingtao November 15. Greek <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Armathia</hi> previously held Chusan Island reported
                    arrived Hong Kong November 14.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
